{"t":"Honeyflower Patch","s":"honeyflower-patch-ae20e","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Honeyflower_Patch_6d762a.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Honeyflower Patch</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Honeyflower Patch\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Honeyflower_Patch_6d762a.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Objects<br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.11 (2)<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">September 03, 2003</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170930160338&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Honeyflower_Patch_6d762a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a honeyflower patch.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Wasp Tower (<a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can use it to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flower</a>.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flower</a>.<br/><br/>Using it is the only way to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flowers</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flowers</a> can be traded with <a href=\"#/wiki/Lee%27Delle\">Lee'Delle</a> for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Studded%20Legs\">Studded Legs</a>. See <a href=\"#/quest/studded-legs-quest\">Studded Legs Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flower</a></li><li>Old Sprites</li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Studded%20Legs\">Studded Legs</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/studded-legs-quest\">Studded Legs Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["studded-legs-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"studded-legs-quest","quest":"Studded Legs Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Usar o canteiro de flores","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}